# Test 2a: Free-field fermion propagator test
# Cold start (identity links), no thermalization, 1 config
# Check pion correlator against analytic free-field result

-------------------------------
[Lattice]
-------------------------------
nX: 8
nY: 8
nZ: 8
nT: 16

-------------------------------
[Gauge Action]
-------------------------------
Beta: 6.0
Update Method: heatbath
Metropolis Epsilon: 0.2
Start Type: cold

-------------------------------
[Monte Carlo]
-------------------------------
Thermalization Sweeps: 0
Number of Configurations: 1
Sweeps Between Measurements: 1
Overrelaxation Sweeps: 0
Configuration Save Frequency: 10
Save Binary Configs: off
Random Seed: 42

-------------------------------
[Measurements]
-------------------------------
Measure Wilson Loops: off
Wilson Loop R Max: 2
Wilson Loop T Max: 2
Measure Polyakov: on
Measure Correlators: on
Verbose Output: on

-------------------------------
[Wilson Fermions]
-------------------------------
Kappa: 0.12
Wilson r: 1.0
CG Max Iterations: 5000
CG Tolerance: 1.0e-12
Solver Type: cg

-------------------------------
[HMC]
-------------------------------
MD Steps: 20
MD Step Size: 0.01
HMC Trajectories: 100
